Native parsing/formatting translates the English casual grammar, dictionaries,
timezone abbreviations and algorithms from chrono-node 2.8.3 (MIT) and dayjs
1.11.13 (MIT). Authentic notices are included. qa/locked-source contains exact
npm archive source for audit only; no JavaScript interpreter or Node runtime is
used by the packaged executable. resources/chrono-en.json is a reproducible
extraction of the locked chrono-node grammar and data, embedded in the binary.

